=== Prompt ===
What is the capital of France?

=== Normal Response ===
The capital of France is Paris. It is located in the north-central part of the country. Paris is known for its iconic landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, Louvre Museum, Notre-Dame Cathedral, and the Arc de Triomphe. It is also a major cultural, economic, and political center of Europe.

=== Ablated Response (multiplier=0.0) ===
The capital of France is Paris.

=== Amplified Response (multiplier=3.0) ===
The capital of France is Paris. It is a city known for its rich history, art, and culture, and is home to many famous landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, Louvre Museum, and Notre-Dame Cathedral. Paris is located in the north-central part of the country.

